<view class="page">
  <view class="brand"><view class="brand-mark">♫</view><view><text class="brand-title">听见</text><text class="brand-sub">LISTEN &amp; FEEL</text></view><text class="pill">原生验证版</text></view>
  <view class="hero"><text class="eyebrow">EVERYDAY, A NEW SOUND</text><text class="hero-title">把生活，调到
喜欢的频率。</text><text class="hero-text">先确认一首完整歌曲，能在微信里一直听。</text></view>
  <view class="notice"><text class="notice-title">{{phase}}</text><text>这是后台播放验收页面，不是最终完整界面，也不代表已经通过真机验证。</text></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">云服务连接</text><button class="small outline" loading="{{healthLoading}}" bindtap="checkHealth">检查连接</button></view><text class="muted">{{cloudStatus}}</text><text class="hint">API 使用微信云调用，音频直接来自已验证的实际音源，不使用云托管公网代理</text></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="tabs"><button class="tab {{mode === 'home' ? 'active' : ''}}" bindtap="discover">发现音乐</button><button class="tab {{mode === 'search' ? 'active' : ''}}" bindtap="search">搜索歌曲</button></view>
    <view class="search-row"><input value="{{query}}" bindinput="input" bindconfirm="search" confirm-type="search" placeholder="输入歌名或歌手"/><button class="primary small" bindtap="search">搜索</button></view>
    <picker mode="selector" range="{{sourceNames}}" value="{{sourceIndex}}" bindchange="sourceChange"><view class="source-picker">搜索来源 · {{sourceNames[sourceIndex]}} <text>⌄</text></view></picker>
  </view>
  <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">{{mode === 'home' ? '发现好音乐' : '搜索结果'}} <text class="muted">{{items.length}} 首</text></text><button wx:if="{{mode === 'home'}}" class="small outline" bindtap="shuffle" disabled="{{loading}}">换一批</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{message}}" class="muted list-message">{{message}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{stale}}" class="hint">当前展示缓存结果</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="empty"><text class="empty-icon">♫</text><text>{{loading || refreshing ? '正在验证可播放歌曲' : '暂未找到可确认完整版的歌曲'}}</text><text class="hint">不使用试听或假歌曲填充结果，系统会定期重新检查</text></view>
  <view class="song" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="playSong"><view class="cover">♫</view><view class="song-meta"><text class="song-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="muted">{{item.artist}}</text><text class="song-album">{{item.album || '—'}} · {{item.sourceText}}</text></view><text class="muted">{{item.durationText}}</text><text class="song-play">▶</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{mode === 'search'}}" class="pagination"><button class="small outline" disabled="{{page &lt;= 1 || loading}}" bindtap="previousPage">上一页</button><text>{{page}}</text><button class="small outline" disabled="{{!hasMore || loading}}" bindtap="nextPage">下一页</button></view>
  <view class="card acceptance"><text class="notice-title">真机验收步骤</text><text>1 · 检查云服务连接，选择一首歌</text><text>2 · 打开事件页，确认切页不停止</text><text>3 · 切到微信聊天，再锁屏至少 30 秒</text><text>4 · 测试耳机控制，再回到小程序检查事件</text><button class="outline" bindtap="diagnostics">打开播放事件页 →</button><text class="hint">不通过时请记录错误码，不改为前台播放或试听来代替验收，音量使用手机系统按键</text></view>
  <view class="footer">作者：DataShare · 仅供个人非商业使用</view>
</view>
<view class="player safe-bottom"><view class="player-info"><text class="song-title">{{player.title}}</text><text class="muted">{{player.artist}}<text wx:if="{{player.source}}"> · {{player.source}}</text></text></view><view class="controls"><button bindtap="previous">◀</button><button class="main-play" bindtap="toggle" disabled="{{!player.title || (player.loading &amp;&amp; !player.failed)}}">{{player.playing ? 'Ⅱ' : '▶'}}</button><button bindtap="next">▶</button></view><view class="progress"><text>{{player.positionText}}</text><slider min="0" max="{{player.duration || 1}}" value="{{player.position}}" step="0.1" disabled="{{!player.duration}}" bindchange="seek" activeColor="#d66a42" backgroundColor="#e8e1d8" block-size="12"/><text>{{player.durationText}}</text></view><text wx:if="{{player.message}}" class="player-message {{player.failed ? 'error-text' : ''}}">{{player.message}}</text></view>
